Rust std (library/std) for slicc's kernel, built with -Zbuild-std. WASI
preview1's std leaves these unsupported; uv and its crates (which, etcetera,
tempfile) call them:
- env::split_paths / join_paths: `:`-separated, as on unix (they panicked);
- env::home_dir: $HOME (None before);
- env::temp_dir: $TMPDIR, else /tmp (panicked);
- env::consts::EXE_SUFFIX / EXE_EXTENSION empty: the kernel runs WASI
  commands by name (python3, not python3.wasm).

